From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:17:19 +0000
Subject: fix(compose): commit the initial lazy viewport before first placement

A LazyList that opens at a non-top index (initialFirstVisibleItemIndex)
first published its children at native offset zero and only converged
through the 150 ms deferred alignment. On the first non-empty placement,
write the matching native offset before children are placed so the
platform applies it in its first layout; later scrolling keeps the
deferred alignment path.

Fork-Patch: compose-lazy-initial-native-viewport
